WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.163
Five hundred and seventy-nine unique lobbying instances mapped to the Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs.

00:00:06.113 --> 00:00:10.295
CIJA lobbied fifty-six percent of all sitting Members of Parliament.

00:00:10.295 --> 00:00:16.704
One hundred and seven lobbying sessions in six months — October 2023 to April 2024.

00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:22.749
Anthony Housefather: sixty-seven CIJA lobbying contacts — the most-lobbied MP in Parliament.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.011
Marco Mendicino: sixty-three contacts while serving as Public Safety Minister.

00:00:28.011 --> 00:00:34.431
The lobbying pipeline spans sponsored travel, military procurement alignments, and intelligence sharing exceptions.

00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:40.374
The network complexity is classified as an NP-HARD graph problem requiring computational analysis.

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:43.454
Five hundred and seventy-nine instances.

00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:46.374
Fifty-six percent of Parliament touched.

00:00:46.374 --> 00:00:48.579
This is not influence.

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:50.704
This is infrastructure.
